          "caption": "Front of the Glenn A. Black House, located on the grounds of Angel Mounds State Historic Site at 8215 E. Pollack Avenue in Evansville, Indiana, United States.  The home of Glenn Black during his many excavations at the site, it is now used as an office for the historic site.  Built in 1937, it is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
